WEBVTT

00:03:58.475 --> 00:04:02.109
that allowed for victims
to forgive perpetrators,

00:04:02.133 --> 00:04:05.316
enabling them to avoid jail time.

00:04:05.889 --> 00:04:08.685
And she was told
that she would be ostracized

00:04:08.709 --> 00:04:11.216
and her family, her in-laws,

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:13.565
they would all be shunned
from the community,

00:04:13.589 --> 00:04:17.672
because many felt that her father
had been well within his right,

00:04:17.696 --> 00:04:19.339
given her transgression.

00:04:20.917 --> 00:04:22.177
She fought on --

00:04:23.235 --> 00:04:24.618
for months.

00:04:24.642 --> 00:04:27.362
But on the final day in court,

00:04:27.386 --> 00:04:30.162
she gave a statement forgiving them.